====Estan's Stall====
[[Estan]]'s Stall is a butcher General Store. It is located outside of the [[Hotel Oasis]], to the right of the Arrow Specialty Shop. According to [[Maike]] in [[Kara Kara Bazaar]], who runs a similar General Store, Estan is her little sister.<ref>{{Cite|My little sister runs a butcher shop over in {{Color BotW|Blue|Gerudo Town}}.|Maike|BotW}}</ref> As Link approaches the Stall, Estan will beckon him towards her.<ref>{{Cite|Willcome!|Estan|BotW}}</ref> When Link makes a purchase from her, Estan will be pleased.<ref>{{Cite|Good purchases, one and all!|Estan|BotW}}</ref> If Link buys all of her stock, Estan will thank him for doing so.<ref>{{Cite|Tank you very much.|Estan|BotW}}</ref>

The [[Rito]] [[Frita]] is always standing by Estan's Stall. While she is enamored with how good the [[Food]] smells and wants to try it, she is disappointed that there is no poultry available.<ref>{{Cite|But now that I'm here, I should enjoy myself! I wanted to start by trying out some of the meat here, but... Well, they don't seem to have poultry.|Frita|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|Are you eyeing the meat selection, too? It just smells so good and looks so tasty... I could stare at it all night long. Oh. It's morning now? I guess I did actually stare at it all night... But if it was poultry sitting here, ready to be eaten... I could stare at it all my life!|Frita|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|The meat they offer here smells so good. I won't be able to limit myself to less than...three helpings at dinner! Oh, but if it was poultry...and cooked as well as this is...I don't know how I'd ever stop!|Frita|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|Hrm... Do they really not have any poultry? *sigh* I wanted poultry...|Frita|BotW}}</ref> Estan notices Frita staring at her Stall, and while she wonders if she has something against meat, she realizes that would be impossible.<ref>{{Cite|That Rito vai keeps shooting me the stink eye... Does she have something against meat? {{Small|No, that's impossible...}}|Estan|BotW}}</ref>

