====Spera's Stall====
Spera's Stall is a small General Store in Gerudo Town. It is located on the southern side of the market, near [[Ashai]]'s [[House]]. Spera sells a Cooking ingredients, all of which are gathered by her husband.<ref name="More">{{Cite|Sarqso! I gotta remember to tell my husband to get some more.|Spera|BotW}}</ref><ref name="Stock">{{Cite|Sarqso! I hope my husband stocked us up with enough.|Spera|BotW}}</ref> As Link approaches her Stall, she advertises how fresh her ingredients are.<ref>{{Cite|Only the freshest!|Spera|BotW}}</ref> At night, she explains that Gerudo Town never sleeps, so she never closes her Stall.<ref>{{Cite|Sav'saaba... This is a city that doesn't sleep, so this store is always open.|Spera|BotW}}</ref> However, this means that she is so busy that she is unable to visit her husband often.<ref>{{Cite|Unfortunately, being so busy means I don't often make it home to my husband...|Spera|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|It does mean I don't see my husband all that often, but we have to make a living. So buy and sell all you like!|Spera|BotW}}</ref> When Link makes a purchase, Spera will thank him.<ref name="More"/><ref name="Stock"/><ref>{{Cite|Sarqso! My husband will be happy, too.|Spera|BotW}}</ref> If Link buys all of her stock, Spera will make plans to close the Stall.<ref>{{Cite|Time to close up...|Spera|BotW}}</ref> She thanks Link for buying everything.<ref>{{Cite|Sarqso from myself and my husband for buying everything.|Spera|BotW}}</ref>

[[Pearle]] stops by Spera's Stall during the day. She explains that [[Mushroom Rice Balls]] are made by Cooking [[Hylian Rice]], [[Rock Salt]], and Mushrooms together.<ref>{{Cite|A foreign vai! Sav'aaq! Do you have rice balls where you come from? Take fluffy steamed {{Color BotW|Blue|Hylian rice}}, and {{Color BotW|Blue|rock salt}} and mushrooms, and you've got {{Color BotW|Blue|mushroom rice balls}}!|Pearle|BotW}}</ref> Since her sister [[Rotana]] has been busy researching the [[Seven Heroines]], she considers making her some.<ref>{{Cite|My sister's been really busy with her research on {{Color BotW|Blue|the seven heroines}} lately... Maybe I'll make some to bring her.|Pearle|BotW}}</ref>

