==={{TotK|-}}===
In the wake of the [[Upheaval]], a massive [[Sand Shroud]] erupted in [[Gerudo Desert]],<ref>{{Cite|Have you seen the thick layer of sand over the desert? That is the sand shroud.|Guy|TotK}}</ref> forcing the residents of [[Gerudo Town]] to take refuge in a [[Gerudo Shelter|Shelter]] beneath the [[Royal Palace]].<ref>{{Cite|I used to run a shop on the surface, but... what with the sand shroud and then those monsters appearing, the guards told me to evacuate.|Romah|TotK}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|The sand shroud has made it far too dangerous to go aboveground right now, so my shop is temporarily closed... But if you've got questions about sand seals, I'd be happy to answer them!|Frelly|TotK}}</ref> The Stalls had to be relocated to the Shelter as well, and although they are still open for business, the Sand Shroud makes it difficult to gather supplies, and as a result, some vendors don't have much products to sell.<ref name="Spera 1">{{Cite|I'm sorry my selection is what it is...   Because of this sand shroud, I can't get word to my husband to let him know what we need to restock...|Spera|TotK}}</ref> But once Link has completed the "[[Riju of Gerudo Town]]" [[Main Quest]] and stopped the raging Sand Shroud,<ref>{{Cite|With the monster defeated, the sand shroud in the Gerudo region vanished.|Adventure Log|TotK}}</ref> vendors will be able to re-open their Stalls on the outside, and Link will have access to their full range of wares.<ref name="Spera 2">{{Cite|With the sand shroud finally dying down, I was able to see my husband at last!  Now the store is fully stocked, so buy as much as you'd like!|Spera|TotK}}</ref> 

They can all be found in the spots they occupied in {{BotW}}, and almost all of them carry the same items.

====Arrow Specialty Shop====
{{Main|Arrow Specialty Shop}}
The Arrow Specialty Shop is a Stall ran by [[Danda]]. In addition to common [[Arrow]], she also sells [[Yellow Chuchu Jelly|Yellow]], [[White Chuchu Jelly|White]] and [[Red Chuchu Jelly]], as well as [[Bomb Flower]]s. In the past her Stall only stocked Arrows, but she decided to adapt to the growing demand as people started attaching things to them.<ref>{{Cite|Are you surprised to see such a hip shop being run by someone my age?  I heard the new big thing is attaching all kinds of stuff to arrows before you shoot them... As a merchant, I've got to embrace the popular trends with open arms.|Danda|TotK}}</ref>

====Fruit Store====
{{Main|Fruit Store}}
The Fruit Store is a small [[Fruit]] Stall ran by Lorn. In the shelter she has very limited supplies and can only sell [[Link]] one [[Voltfruit]] and one [[Hydromelon]]. Once the Sand Shroud has subsided, however, she will go back to the surface and add [[Palm Fruit]]s to her wares. Her Stall will also be able to stock three of each [[Fruit]] at once.

====Ardin's Stall====
{{Stub|TotK}}
[[Ardin]]'s Stall offers a selection of [[Mushroom]]s, and her stock remains the same once she leaves the [[Gerudo Shelter]].

