====Spera's Stall====
{{Stub|TotK}}
[[Spera]]'s Stall was really impacted by the [[Sand Shroud]]. Her husband usually takes care of gathering her products, but she can't reach out to him from inside the [[Gerudo Shelter|Shelter]], and she apologizes for having a very limited selection.<ref name="Spera 1"/> Once it is safe to go back outside, she is able to see her husband again, and to stock her usage ranges of wares.<ref name="Spera 2"/>

